  "summary": "In APP.bin, update_entry_boot_app (0x0026887c) processes 3:/ZK-INKJET-NANO-BOOT.bin and then 3:/ZK-INKJET-NANO-APP.bin with base offset 0x03000000. update_flash_file_to_raw (0x0026ccf8) treats param_2 as raw SD base and writes data in 0x200-byte blocks via sd_raw_write_aligned (0x00232500). sd_raw_write_aligned requires 0x200 alignment and calls sd_fmi_block_io (0x00294584) with LBA/count/buffer. sd_fmi_block_io programs MMIO at 0xB10064xx/0xB10068xx and performs LBA transfers. This confirms the update workflow writes the APP image to raw SD offset 0x03000000.",
